   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory Services to the General Authority for Survey and Geospatial Information</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen Saudi Arabia&#x2019;s national geospatial infrastructure and enhance institutional capacities within GEOSA to support sustainable development and Vision 2030 objectives. It builds on previous successful collaborations between UNDP and GEOSA and focuses on technical consultancy, capacity development, stakeholder engagement, and ecosystem localization.The project is structured around four key outputs:Policy Support and Technical Assistance &#x2013; Enhancing geospatial governance</narrative>
  </description>
